entries[99112] = { ["name"] = "Tunic of the Barbed Assassin", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Leather\n3440 Armor\n+1,840 Agility\n+3,121 Stamina\n+ 1,288 Haste\n+ 1,232 Mastery\n\nRed Socket\nRed Socket\nRed Socket\nSocket Bonus: + 180 Agility\n\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Rogue\nRequires Level 90\n\nBarbed Assassin Battlegear (0/5)\nGloves of the Barbed Assassin\nTunic of the Barbed Assassin\nHelmet of the Barbed Assassin\nLegguards of the Barbed Assassin\nSpaulders of the Barbed Assassin\n(2) Set : When you generate a combo point from Revealing Strike's effect, Honor Among Thieves, or Seal Fate, your next combo point generating ability has its energy cost reduced by [ Backstab : 2 ] [ Dispatch : 6 / 15 ]. Stacks up to 5 times.\n(4) Set : Killing Spree deals 10% more damage every time it strikes a target. Abilities against a target with Vendetta on it increase your mastery by 250 for 5 sec, stacking up to 20 times. Every time you Backstab, you have a 4% chance to replace your Backstab with Ambush that can be used regardless of Stealth.\nSell Price:" }
