entries[99664] = { ["name"] = "Shoulderguards of the Shattered Vale", ["text"] = "Flexible\nBinds when picked up\nShoulder Leather\n2488 Armor\n+1,209 Agility\n+2,054 Stamina\n+ 960 Haste\n+ 613 Expertise\n\nRed Socket\nRed Socket\nSocket Bonus: + 120 Agility\n\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Druid\nRequires Level 90\n\nArmor of the Shattered Vale (0/5)\nHandguards of the Shattered Vale\nHeadguard of the Shattered Vale\nBreeches of the Shattered Vale\nShoulderguards of the Shattered Vale\nTunic of the Shattered Vale\n(2) Set : When Barkskin fades, Savage Defense is automatically activated, and a 20 Rage Frenzied Regeneration is automatically cast.\n(4) Set : Activating Frenzied Regeneration and Savage Defense will cause a heal over time on yourself based on 30% of your Attack Power over 8 sec.\nSell Price:" }
